   "line": [
    "Nc3"
   ],
   "spoken": "The Four Knights Scotch is ideal for practising the fundamentals of getting every piece out — but it's no beginner's toy: it's popular at the very top and genuinely dangerous for the defender who isn't precise with the theory.",
   "kind": "plan"
  },
  {
   "ply": 6,
   "t": 70.5,
   "fen": "r1bqk1nr/pppp1ppp/2n5/2b1p3/4P3/2N2N2/PPPP1PPP/R1BQKB1R w KQkq - 4 4",
   "line": [
    "Bc5"
   ],
   "spoken": ""
  },
  {
   "ply": 7,
   "t": 89,
   "fen": "r1bqk1nr/pppp1ppp/2n5/2b1N3/4P3/2N5/PPPP1PPP/R1BQKB1R b KQkq - 0 4",
   "line": [
    "Nxe5"
   ],
   "spoken": "The bishop to c5 is a well-known inaccuracy, and the way to punish it is to snatch the central pawn without fear. The reply people dread, a bishop sacrifice with check, isn't merely harmless here — it's essentially losing for the defender.",
   "kind": "tactic"
  },
  {
   "ply": 8,
   "t": 104,
   "fen": "r1bqk1nr/pppp1ppp/8/2b1n3/4P3/2N5/PPPP1PPP/R1BQKB1R w KQkq - 0 5",
   "line": [
    "Nxe5"
   ],
   "spoken": ""
  },
  {
   "ply": 7,
   "t": 106,
   "fen": "r1bqk1nr/pppp1ppp/2n5/2b1N3/4P3/2N5/PPPP1PPP/R1BQKB1R b KQkq - 0 4",
   "line": [],
   "spoken": ""
  },
  {
   "ply": 8,
   "t": 107.5,
   "fen": "r1bqk1nr/pppp1ppp/8/2b1n3/4P3/2N5/PPPP1PPP/R1BQKB1R w KQkq - 0 5",
   "line": [
    "Nxe5"
   ],
   "spoken": "Then the pawn advances to d4, forking the two minor pieces and forcing the opponent to give one up. The correct retreat is the bishop back to d6; the instinctive capture of the pawn is bad, because the queen then skewers the knight and the game can collapse quickly.",
   "kind": "tactic"
  },
  {
   "ply": 9,
   "t": 112,
   "fen": "r1bqk1nr/pppp1ppp/8/2b1n3/3PP3/2N5/PPP2PPP/R1BQKB1R b KQkq - 0 5",
   "line": [
    "d4"
   ],
   "spoken": ""
  },
  {
   "ply": 10,
   "t": 145.5,
   "fen": "r1bqk1nr/pppp1ppp/1b6/4n3/3PP3/2N5/PPP2PPP/R1BQKB1R w KQkq - 1 6",
   "line": [
    "Bb6"
   ],
   "spoken": "The bishop retreat to b6 is also poor, because the defender won't even get a pawn back for the fork. A concession that hands over material for nothing is no way to meet the trick."
  },
  {
   "ply": 11,
   "t": 150,
   "fen": "r1bqk1nr/pppp1ppp/1b6/4P3/4P3/2N5/PPP2PPP/R1BQKB1R b KQkq - 0 6",
   "line": [
    "dxe5"
