   "line": [
    "Qxd8"
   ],
   "spoken": "And the one detail to verify when running this combination — make sure your own king isn't exposed to an in-between check that turns the tables. Here it's fine, but confirming there's no such resource is exactly the discipline these tactics demand.",
   "kind": "tactic"
  },
