   "line": [
    "Qh4",
    "Ne5"
   ],
   "spoken": "Another scarecrow is an aggressive queen lunge — but a quiet pawn move sends it packing, after which the knight develops and the bishop fianchettoes on the diagonal that pawn move just opened. Don't be spooked; answer it and develop.",
   "kind": "tactic",
