   "spoken": "The critical refutation try is the bishop sacrifice with check — and the thing to understand is that the king's exposure is only temporary. You castle by hand, stepping the king to safety and bringing the rook to the file. What's permanent, by contrast, is the lasting grip on the centre and the lead in development.",
